cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scenelift in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "scenelift: casual phone video to a metric, editable, object-level 3D scene"
abstract: >-
  scenelift turns a short phone video or a few photos into a 3D scene in real
  metres in which every object is separate. It keeps measured and generated
  geometry apart, and attaches a calibrated uncertainty to every length and
  every fit answer.
type: software
authors:
